# Non-secret paging policy; alerts-and-dashboard.md, "Paging invariant".
# Both the timer and OnFailure hook read /etc/trend-investing/reporter.env.
# Environment values override this file. Changes apply on the next firing.
TI_ESCALATE_AFTER=session
# session: a page only when it makes sense, weekdays 05:30–16:00 ET on an
# NYSE session day, after detection grace. The orchestrator acts first.
# Also the built-in default when this file is missing. A duration (e.g. 30m)
# retains delayed escalation; 0 pages immediately outside scheduled windows.
# Capital-safety is unchanged. Negative durations are refused.
# Same schedule used by the adapter; a missing file means no windows.
TI_IBKR_MAINTENANCE_FILE=/etc/trend-investing/ibkr-maintenance.json
